{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tvdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"tvdbShowId":252696,"seasonNumber":2},"checkedAt":1793481316602,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":[{"episodeNumber":1,"title":"Un brutto voto","synopsis":"Nobita got a zero on his paper and is afraid of telling his mom the truth. So Doraemon gets out the Guiding Machine gadget which produces a fortune telling him to wait till 7:00 pm to tell mom.","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":2,"title":"La corda magica","synopsis":"Nobita uses the Substitution Rope to switch identities with Gian and become stronger than him, but soon mixes up his identity with Doraemon, Shizuka and a dog as well. (Not to be confused with a 1986 episode with a similar title)","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":3,"title":"L'orologio pazzo","titleLanguage":"ita"},{"episodeNumber":4,"title":"La finestra degli innamorati","titleLanguage":"ita"},{"episodeNumber":5,"title":"Lezione di sci","titleLanguage":"ita"},{"episodeNumber":6,"title":"I due Kin Kong","titleLanguage":"ita"},{"episodeNumber":7,"title":"Il fascino della diva (1)","synopsis":"Learning that teen idol Mari Marui is having a shoot at a nearby park, Doraemon and Nobita go there along with Gian, Suneo and Shizuka, but she is nowhere to be found. Mari, who is tired of her daily routine arranged by her manager mother, wishes to take a break, so she switches places with Nobita using the Substitution Bar.","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":8,"title":"Il fascino della diva (2)","synopsis":"Nobita, as Mari, is hesitant to go on stage to film the music segment. Mrs. Marui becomes angry with her.","titleLanguage":"ita","synopsisLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":9,"title":"Party Image","titleLanguage":"eng"},{"episodeNumber":10,"title":"Sciare nel parco","titleLanguage":"ita"},{"episodeNumber":11,"title":"La campana dei sogni","synopsis":"Doraemon is ashamed when Nobita says he wants to be the